+| jaar 3 | A1–A2 | A2 | A2–B1 | A2–B1 | B1 |
+| jaar 4 | A2 (writing A1) | A2 | A2–B1 | B1 | B1–B2 |
+| jaar 5 | — | — | — | B1–B1+ (reading B2) | B2 |
+| jaar 6 | — | — | — | — | B2 (reading C1) |
